                    </p>
                    <a
                        href="/#contact"
                        class="bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white px-8 sm:px-10 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-xs sm:text-base transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl inline-flex items-center gap-3 group"
                    >
                        <span>Contact Us</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-xs sm:text-sm transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i>
